sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant O1 as Origin A
    participant R as Redis
    participant O2 as Origin B
    participant Recv as Receiver
    C->>O1: POST /events/abc + body
    O1->>R: EVALSHA append.lua — durable append
    R-->>O1: committed append result
    Note over O1: OnStreamAppend records one local dirty hint
    O1-->>C: 204 · byte committed · hint recorded
    Note over O1: crash before the dirty worker arms a wake
    Note over R: cursor < tail · no wake armed · local hint lost
    loop boot or eager recovery · periodic floor every 30s
        O2->>R: List + GetMany across slots · batch linked tails
        Note over O2: cursor < tail → a wake is owed
        O2->>R: EVALSHA arm_wake.lua — generation++ · ZADD due
        O2->>Recv: POST webhook · delivered after Origin A is gone
        Recv-->>O2: 200 {done:true}
        O2->>R: EVALSHA ack.lua — cursor → tail
    end
